    "name": "Scheduling poll reply must use --sender-only, not reply-all",
    "category": "hard-success",
    "bug_ref": "Scheduling poll reply-all (commit f52ff53)",
    "description": "When responding to a scheduling poll email sent to multiple recipients, the reply should use --sender-only to avoid broadcasting availability to all poll recipients. Reply-all is the default, but scheduling poll responses are an explicit exception. This tests the sender-only override for poll replies."
